<title>UK: McAlpine has 67 pct of Raine.</title>
<headline>McAlpine has 67 pct of Raine.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction group Alfred McAlpine Plc said on Monday it held 67.26 percent of Raine Plc's issued share capital.</p>
<p>McAlpine launched its bid for Raine earlier this year in an offer valuing its takeover target at 44.3 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
